alderpointdns (0.4.0~beta2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Renamed the project from BindGuard to Alderpoint DNS ahead of external
    beta. Package, service, path, and environment-variable names now use
    alderpointdns/ALDERPOINTDNS_; the underlying bindguard system user/group
    is intentionally kept for upgrade safety. See docs/compatibility.md and
    docs/migrating-from-bindguard.md.

